<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Metropolitan Bank Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Metropolitan Bank Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the period ended Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     0.26     vs	     0.29</p>
<p>    Net			255.11     vs	   230.44</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     0.78     vs	     1.42</p>
<p>    Net			693.20     vs	 1,053.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Company is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
